To make them fully functional, we will use two industry-standard Flutter packages:

geolocator: To access the device's actual GPS hardware.

local_auth: To trigger the device's native Face Scan / Biometric authentication.

Here is exactly how to make them functional.

Step 1: Add the required dependencies
Open your terminal in VS Code and run this command to install the real hardware packages:

Bash
flutter pub add geolocator local_auth